{
  "id": "ISA.52",
  "number": "52",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaia 52",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "52",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 52"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "52",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Walaksei Jerusalem konyoru torornatet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’eet, ng’eet, ilaach kimnateng’ung’, ee Sion; ilaach ngoroiguk che kororon, ee Jerusalem, nganaset ne tilil: amu koboch nguno ko ma kobwanjinin che ma kimuratan ak che ma tililen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelekte temburiek; ng’eet, tebi ng’ony, ee Jerusalem: itiach ratutik che mi kaating’ung’, ee cheptab Sion ne kigeluul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mwaei Jehovah ko u ni kole, Kigialdak buch; ak kitiachok ama eng’ feda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mwaei Kiptaiyat Jehovah ko u ni kole, Kichortagei bikyuk eng’ tai koba Misri koek toek eng’ oloto: ak kiinyalil ichek Asuriaindet buch. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaei anyun Jehovah kole, Ayae nee eng’ yu, amu kigimut bikyuk buch? Iteitos ichek che bou, mwaei Jehovah, ak kichubei kainennyu kotugul, betut komugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nae anyun bikyuk kainennyu: naei anyun eng’ betunoto kole ane ne ang’alali; ogeero, ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kororon ne tia eng’ tulonok, kelyekab inendet ne ibu logoiywek che miach, ne mwaitoi kalyet, ne ibu logoiywek che miach che bo mieindo, ne mwaitoi yetunet; ne mwachin Sion kolenjin, Laitorani Kamuktaindeng’ung’! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutitab ribiguk! Waachei ichek, tiendos kibagenge; amu tun keerei ichek togoch eng’ togoch, ye weeksei Jehovah konyonei Sion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboiboitu, otiense tugul, okwek komoswek che kigemeto che bo Jerusalem; amu kigogaigai Jehovah bikyik, kigotiach Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kigobarta Jehovah eunnyi ne tilil eng’ taitab bororiosiek tugul; ak keerei tabanwek tugul che bo ng’ony yetunetab Kamuktaindennyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oba, oba, omande eng’ oloto, amat otwa kiy ne ma tilil; omande eng’ kwenunnyi; otililitu, okwek che oibe tugukab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu momandoi eng’ kagirgiret, anan omwei: amu indoenok Jehovah; ak letwok Kamuktaindetab Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kit ne kinyalilji Otwoginndetab Jehovah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, boisie otwogindennyu ng’omnatet, kieeti ak kitorori, ak kotororit mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ko u ye kikwong’enen che chang’, (kiging’em togennyi kosiir ne bo chi age tugul, ak kiging’em itondanyi kosiir werikab bik,) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibisi anyun bororiosiek che chang’; namei kut laitorinik amu inendet: amu tun keerei tuguk che kitom kemwachi ichek, ak koguiyo tuguk che kitom kogas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
